<title>JAPAN: Asahi Kagaku Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Kagaku Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.38		vs	    1.18</p>
<p> Operating	   94    million	  vs	   15    million</p>
<p> Current	    111    million	  vs	   33    million</p>
<p> Net		   57    million	  vs	   27    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.94 yen	  vs	    7.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Kagaku Kogyo Co Ltd is a manufacturer of industrial-use plastic products and construction materials.</p>
